        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "DC Universe Online is a free-to-play superhero / supervillian MMORPG that lets players create their own unique tights-wearing hero or villain and roam the streets of places like Gotham City and Metropolis fighting or creating crime. Players fight alongside such iconic DC Comics characters as Superman and Batman, Lex Luthor and The Joker, and many others. Excellent physics help bring comic book action and combat to life, all under the creative direction of noted comic book artist Jim Lee.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "DC Universe Online es un MMORPG de superhéroes y supervillanos gratuito que permite crear un héroe o villano único, con mallas, y recorrer las calles de lugares como Gotham City y Metrópolis, combatiendo o cometiendo crímenes. Los jugadores luchan junto a personajes tan icónicos de DC Comics como Superman y Batman, Lex Luthor y el Joker, entre otros muchos. Una física excelente ayuda a dar vida a la acción y los combates del cómic, bajo la dirección creativa del reconocido dibujante Jim Lee.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2011",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
